id: og_terraces
name: Terraces
description: Terraces. Growing terraces cut into a hillside, each one wider than the one above it, all of them full of cover and none of them walled. Built as a terraced hill farm and its irrigation works; the channels were shut off at the top and the lower terraces are still wet.

grid: 1.8
wall_thickness: 0.28

